ind":"update","title":"Update 0.34.0: a regenerated desert, new models and hull damage","summary":"This one is big. I regenerated the whole desert and put new models on almost every gun. Ships now go down by their hull, and there are 15 new tracks. Your save loads, but the world is new. Your cruiser starts at the map's starting point, course target and prospecting progress are gone, and the NPC ships are spread out fresh. Settlements and wreck salvage you already found may be unknown again. Ship, crew and storage stay, and old tracks become their successors (see Removed). Rockets need methane","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T21:47:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043050","verified_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943770-1846651706692417","game_id":"steam-4943770","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.33.0: rockets, a mortar and repair drones","summary":"Rockets are in. Four launchers, a mortar, and a fair bit of work on how hits land. Your save keeps working. On first load the production targets reset once, the search radar starts on listening (J switches it) and the stealth plan is empty. Old saves don't have the new ammo yet, the ammunition fabricator makes it. Blueprints that use NPC gear load without those modules, and the blueprint card tells you how many. A new game starts with a reworked Hyperion that already has the launchers on board. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:22:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4943770-1846018067939356","game_id":"steam-4943770","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.28.0: the swarm spits acid, plus a tactical pause and a helm gunsight","summary":"The swarm finally fights back from range. Three creature types that used to just circle you now spit acid at your cruiser. To make that manageable, Space pauses the whole fight, you can fire straight from the helm, and messages no longer vanish for good. Your save from 0.24.0 loads, but it's missing two parts. Fire control and the periscope now depend on two real modules, the Fire Computer and the Periscope. Old saves don't have them, so the command view won't compute firing solutions and the pe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T20:47:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939356","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4943770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4943770":"2026-10-26T05:32:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4943770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5199590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4943770","app_id":4943770,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a338fc518019172a27573a390f9f9ebcdc824594c9034932f443c2413ea0964c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Sand Cruiser is a colony sim in which the colony drives and fights. Your settlement is a land cruiser crossing a dead 